$MDESC::Type = "VIP";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> VIP Assassination" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Avicord's Planet" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Night" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
      	"\n<f1>Max Bases: <f0> 3/7" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> both have small army units stranded on this remote planet.  Each unit is all that remains of a convoy assigned to protect a High General of each tribe!  Seven assorted bases should offer ample hiding places for your General and decoy.\n\nProtect your General while attempting to kill the enemy General!  The first team to assassinate their enemy's General shall be the victor!";